claim.claim-text:
(a) treating a biological sample obtained from the woman with an agent that differentially modifies methylated and unmethylated DNA;
(b) detecting the amount of DNA sequence of CASP8, PTPN6, THY1, or TMEFF2, in the sample; and
(c) comparing the amount of the DNA sequence with a standard control, wherein an increase from the control indicates the presence or an increased risk for developing the pregnancy-associated condition.
